# Third-party art that may not be redistributed. Download it yourself (see README).
/Assets/Art/ThirdParty/TinySwordsFreePack/*
!/Assets/Art/ThirdParty/TinySwordsFreePack/README.md
!/Assets/Art/ThirdParty/TinySwordsFreePack/README.md.meta
# The Lancer card portrait is made from that pack too; the repo ships a stand-in (portrait_lancer_fallback.png).
/Assets/Art/Cards/portrait_lancer.png
/Assets/Art/Cards/portrait_lancer.png.meta

# Music tracks are not covered for redistribution. Drop your own in (see README).
/Assets/Audio/Music/*
!/Assets/Audio/Music/README.md
!/Assets/Audio/Music/README.md.meta
